        Mark Brown <broonie@kernel.org>,
        Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>, linux-spi@vger.kernel.org
To: linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org, stable@vger.kernel.org
Return-path: <linux-kernel-owner@vger.kernel.org>
